From 47e8d98d00579c13778c297cf04456093f5ac33d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:21:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Manual focus slider (diting)

A slider (0..100, 0 = infinity end) to set the lens position directly,
next to the autofocus, for scenes where it can't settle on the right
focus. Needs libcamera-diting >= 0.7.0-12 (LensPosition and AfMode
controls). Setting the slider or tapping a subject turns the other off.
---
